-- 0413 legacy_cafe_history_data — the old café till's sales (Morabaa, 2 June to
-- 31 October 2026) loaded into legacy_cafe_hours, legacy_cafe_item_days and
-- legacy_cafe_products (0412) on every database, hosted included, by the
-- deploy itself: 1866 day-hours, 8479 day-product rows and 183 product
-- prices, at the Touch Padel branch (c0000000-…-0001, migration 0122).
--
-- GENERATED from client-data/cafe-pos-2026/history-*.csv by migrationRowsSql()
-- in scripts/lib/legacy-cafe.mjs; the CSVs are written by
-- client-data/cafe-pos-2026/extract.py from the till's nine PDF exports.
-- tests/legacy-cafe-source.test.ts fails if this file and the CSVs disagree,
-- and holds the CSVs to the till's own printed totals. Never edit the values
-- by hand.
--
-- It also writes the owner's cost sheet onto the live menu items (section 1,
-- written by hand, not generated).
--
-- Re-runnable and harmless where the rows already exist: on conflict do
-- nothing. No schema change, no lock beyond the row writes.

set lock_timeout = '3s';
set statement_timeout = '60s';

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. The owner's cost sheet onto the live menu (menu_item_costs).
--
-- Majed, 2026-11-09 (client-data/item-costs-2026-11.md): what one unit of each
-- item costs the club. 51 of the 72 menu items are on his sheet; the rows
-- below are those, matched by hand to the hosted menu by category and name,
-- and written here by menu item id AND English name, so a database whose menu
-- has another item under that id (or no such item: every fresh stack, CI)
-- gets nothing. An item that already has a cost keeps it (on conflict do
-- nothing), so a cost the owner typed in the operator is never overwritten.
-- Like app.set_item_cost, a FIRST cost also fills the order lines of that item
-- that had no cost snapshot; a failure there is a warning, never a failed
-- deploy.
--
-- The sheet names no sizes, so the cost stands for every size of an item, as
-- it would if typed into Menu > cost. Left without a cost (not on the sheet,
-- or not expressible per item): Espresso (single 300, double 540: two costs,
-- one item), Spanish Latte, V60, Cold Brew, Iraqi Tea, Hibiscus Tea,
-- Watermelon, Mixed smoothie, Cheesecake, Iced Chocolate, the three milk
-- drinks, the three cocktails, Protein, Immunity Shot, Court Energy, Taj
-- Special and Padel Fresh.
